{"headword":"נָאוֶה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj. comely, seemly</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> m. <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.14\">Ct 2:14</a> + 3 times; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָאוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:1\" href=\"/Psalms.33.1\">ψ 33:1</a> + 4 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.2\">Je 6:2</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>comely, beautiful</em>, of woman <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.5\">Ct 1:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.4\">6:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפָה</span>); of face <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.14\">2:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מַרְאֶה)</span>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">נָוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.2\">Je 6:2</a> (fig. of Jerus.; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעֻנָּגָה</span>); of mouth <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.3\">Ct 4:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂפָתוֹת</span>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>seemly</em>, of praise <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהִלָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:1\" href=\"/Psalms.33.1\">ψ 33:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:1\" href=\"/Psalms.147.1\">147:1</a>; subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂפַת־יֶתֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.7\">Pr 17:7</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.3\">Ct 4:3</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּעֲנוּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.10\">19:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּבוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.1\">26:1</a>. So also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:5\" href=\"/Psalms.93.5\">ψ 93:5</a> Mass (anom. fem.) v. [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, נָאָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_נָאָה\">נאה</a>] supr."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB06006","strong_numbers":["5000"],"next_hw":"נְאוֹת","prev_hw":"נָאָה","all_cited":true,"quotes"